1
00:00:00,081 --> 00:00:05,501
(Raj:)Now, here are some secret facts
about each of you,

2
00:00:05,653 --> 00:00:08,563
(Raj:)including whether
you are the murderer.

3
00:00:08,723 --> 00:00:10,033
(Raj:)Throughout the game, feel free

4
00:00:10,191 --> 00:00:12,231
(Raj:)to ask each other questions
to uncover clues.

5
00:00:12,393 --> 00:00:13,393
(Penny:)Got it.

6
00:00:13,561 --> 00:00:15,231
(Penny:)Hey, who's the murderer?

7
00:00:18,066 --> 00:00:20,236
(Raj:)Any question but that.

8
00:00:20,902 --> 00:00:22,072
(Penny:)Sorry.

9
00:00:22,236 --> 00:00:23,906
(Penny:)Hey, who's not the murderer?

10
00:00:26,941 --> 00:00:29,551
(Stuart:)Bernadette, can you not stand
so close to me?

11
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:30,950
(Bernadette:)What do you care? You're dead.

12
00:00:31,112 --> 00:00:34,462
(Stuart:)Suit yourself.
But I can kind of see up your skirt.

13
00:00:43,458 --> 00:00:45,238
(Sheldon:)Thank you for my bobble head.

14
00:00:45,893 --> 00:00:48,433
(Howard:)Thank you for not making fun
of me during my speech.

15
00:00:48,596 --> 00:00:50,736
(Sheldon:)It wasn't easy. Was it Buzz?

16
00:00:54,602 --> 00:00:57,102
(Howard:)We can't show up to
your mom's empty-handed.

17
00:00:57,271 --> 00:00:58,721
(Howard:)We should bring something.

18
00:00:58,873 --> 00:01:01,653
(Sheldon:)I already am.
I'm bringing the gift of knowledge.

